# FarmShift Nepal — Environment Configuration Template
# =======================================================
# FarmShift operates out-of-the-box using public endpoints with ZERO required API keys:
#
# 1. NASA POWER Agroclimatology API: Public, no key required
#    Endpoint: https://power.larc.nasa.gov/api/temporal/daily/point
#
# 2. NASA EOSDIS GIBS WMTS Tile Service: Public, no key required
#    Endpoint: https://gibs.earthdata.nasa.gov/wmts/epsg3857/best/
#
# 3. Open-Meteo Weather & Soil Forecast: Free for non-commercial & educational use, no key required
#    Endpoint: https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast
#
# 4. OpenStreetMap Nominatim Geocoding: Public, rate-limited to 1 request/second
#    Endpoint: https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/
#
# =======================================================
# Optional Custom Configuration (Prefix with VITE_ to expose to frontend):
# =======================================================

# VITE_APP_TITLE="FarmShift Nepal"
# VITE_APP_URL="https://farmshift.pokhrelpratik.com.np"
